  "npcs": [
    {
      "id": "caetha-redglass",
      "name": "Caetha Redglass",
      "sourceType": "immersive_npc_roster",
      "sourceFile": "NPC Rosters.docx",
      "province": "Eldermere",
      "provinceKey": "eldermere",
      "settlement": "Oakenshire",
      "settlementKey": "eldermere:Oakenshire",
      "description": "Caetha Redglass is furious, sharp-tongued, hard to comfort, and even harder to fool, but her cruelty is mostly scar tissue from a life where every offer of kindness came with a hook in it. As a Half-Orc, she carries Nebyrr’s mixed-heritage pull toward survival, structure, and principled endurance, twisted by betrayal into a belief that deals are safer than love and violence is more honest than sympathy.\nAt the Red Pit Bathhouse, Caetha fights because pain is familiar, coin is clean, and the crowd’s roar is easier to trust than quiet concern. Her long-term addiction is to battle-grade ichor—especially the black-market, rage-bright kind used by pit crews and desperate duelists—and the Brass Concordat sees her as both a dangerous asset and a living witness to how Eldermere’s polished civic order still profits from broken people.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Oakenshire is a City in Eldermere, under Cooperative Commonwealth, with moderate danger, Farming, Partial forest, Mountain range terrain. Local records favor Altruistic, Lawful, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin. Half-Orc reads through the Human entry of the race compendium, within Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, marked by Nebyrr. The local form is read through Half-Orc (Human + Orc Lineage). Humans are highly adaptable and found in nearly every environment across the world. They are known for their cultural diversity, short generational cycles, and unmatched versatility among mortal races. Table cues: Resourceful, Skillful, Versatile; starting tendency Neutral - Neutral - Neutral - Neutral.",
      "rumors": [
        "Caetha Redglass knows why an ichor ledger changed hands last Valkhaday.",
        "Caetha Redglass has a contact in Th’oyndor who will deny everything."
      ],
      "plotHooks": [
        "Caetha Redglass asks the party to protect a household member without revealing why.",
        "A rival faction offers proof that Caetha Redglass's public story is incomplete."
      ],
